  "description": "Foveus .NET SDK (private beta). Captures inbound ASP.NET Core requests (net6.0/net8.0), outbound HttpClient calls made through IHttpClientFactory, ILogger logs and logged exceptions, and links them into parent and child executions across instrumented services. Worker and background jobs become executions when you mark each unit of work with IMetricsCollector.BeginExecution. MassTransit consumers are traced when you call cfg.AddFoveusInstrumentation(context). Requires a Foveus API key.",
  "iconFile": "beta-foveus-icon.png",
  "id": "Foveus.SDK",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-31T02:13:52.2Z",
