  "packageHash": "M2NY4QsYh9ObQqgifMvTSxk7eIDDzl7gRbeWkhqX47yYlmlGleC9PFLN0E0YDYt+jN+hAB1L2/JeJbUGh7jElA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 1105345,
  "published": "2026-10-31T02:10:06.943Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Private beta.\n      - Inbound ASP.NET Core request capture (net6.0 and net8.0 targets) and outbound HttpClient instrumentation.\n      - ILogger log capture; logged exceptions are reported as errors and grouped into Issues.\n      - Parent and child execution propagation across instrumented HTTP services.\n      - Explicit execution boundaries for worker jobs with IMetricsCollector.BeginExecution.\n      - Opt-in MassTransit instrumentation via cfg.AddFoveusInstrumentation(context).\n      - Invalid configuration disables Foveus with a diagnostic instead of stopping the application.\n      - Telemetry the SDK could not deliver is counted and reported to Foveus.\n      The netstandard2.0 target provides logging, outbound HTTP and metrics; ASP.NET Core middleware requires net6.0 or later. .NET Framework hosts are not tested.",
